 "DellG5SE-Fan-Linux", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8e64a2aed1adeb67c1258feddecc31afea1bc638", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2021-04-09T15:23:19Z", "repo": "DellG5SE-Fan-Linux", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e6c94c0d2aa44220e3b9d3b1742451f379f24ab6", "message": "Create EC_addresses", "created_at": "2021-04-09T15:20:21Z", "repo": "DellG5SE-Fan-Linux", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a80d07e00a909c1581b8cc161679236f2f1ad0a7", "message": "typo", "created_at": "2021-04-09T09:41:15Z", "repo": "DellG5SE-Fan-Linux", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "14c3b380fca0d8771c92d3f7f07fbbce033dfe84", "message": "typo", "created_at": "2021-04-09T09:40:40Z", "repo": "DellG5SE-Fan-Linux", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "15f2582ecfeb18a223ae8d65196288bb6d6a31fb", "message": "typo", "created_at": "2021-04-09T07:39:29Z", "repo": "DellG5SE-Fan-Linux", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "23022e2dea85e00cf7a4e2d7e7733e37fdaa4b30", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2021-04-09T07:25:19Z", "repo": "DellG5SE-Fan-Linux", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "442d64a3f6405b56564ab1a1b7d72a2bc8da8e0e", "message": "Better gpu fan control\n\nwriting directly to the embedded controller gives a better gpu fan control. If you're using this, **be sure to have the sames CPUaddr and GPUaddr**.", "created_at": "2021-04-09T07:17:06Z", "repo": "DellG5SE-Fan-Linux", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "80128f77ecf5ca8c9c59b4b7f1af702bad1625fe", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2021-03-19T17:26:57Z", "repo": "DellG5SE-Fan-Linux", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "74d9a2ac61e926e68b755e955a08de39eff5527d", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2021-03-19T17:15:01Z", "repo": "DellG5SE-Fan-Linux", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9b53a42f02e1593165de1c90d172ab087e4bc79b", "message": "Add set-only option\n\nTo set fans to (cpu_fan_speed, gpu_fan_speed), pass a negative timer (for example -1), and fan speeds  instead of threshold temperatures.\r\nFor instance, this command will set fans to half speed.\r\n```shell\r\nDellFan 128 128  -1\r\n```\r\nthe scale is between 0 and 256, but the dellsmm interface will set the fan speed to 0, half-speed, or full speed only.", "created_at": "2021-03-19T17:11:19Z", "repo": "DellG5SE-Fan-Linux", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "acab21cb569a8f4750358516780587fd37e3e34e", "message": "cpp doc", "created_at": "2021-03-16T08:42:31Z", "repo": "DellG5SE-Fan-Linux", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "83866e28bb4286a570addfc4f4b5b582a8f3fcbe", "message": "cpp rewrite.\n\nearly version. takes 2/3 arguments : lowtemp hightemp in  \u00b0C and timer in sec.", "created_at": "2021-03-16T08:15:44Z", "repo": "DellG5SE-Fan-Linux", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3eb0697f925230555c172ab42f3f55a218e1fd47", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2021-03-11T10:23:23Z", "repo": "DellG5SE-Fan-Linux", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a777587d7ace0bb570acd8fe047c1f9cfb2113d8", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2021-03-11T10:12:23Z", "repo": "DellG5SE-Fan-Linux", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "903754375fb31e75bfd1da6c745ba9d745a666cb", "message": "Fallback on Dellsmm if l10temp and zenmonitor are not available \n\nDell smm is slower to update the cpu temp, and gives cpu average temp instead of Tdie / Tctl which correspond to the high spot of the cpu.\r\nI don't know which one is better to use tbh.", "created_at": "2021-03-06T13:29:40Z", "repo": "DellG5SE-Fan-Linux", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1f20dbda969263b31fb9db7c50459835b4658488", "message": "typo from last commit", "created_at": "2021-03-05T11:06:58Z", "repo": "DellG5SE-Fan-Linux", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0f87c402a97ad0bc77879ec0f18fe206d8f62751", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2021-03-05T11:06:05Z", "repo": "DellG5SE-Fan-Linux", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5a25fac80e2839de8c3d2c6fcf984efda3290357", "message": "support for zenpower/zenmonitor and -set argument", "created_at": "2021-03-05T10:56:21Z", "repo": "DellG5SE-Fan-Linux", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b499b732b0828b8694389922c09bf2e7e9e36ab8", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2021-02-12T21:51:16Z", "repo": "DellG5SE-Fan-Linux", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3849f64b528fa3595b26de6fe34695f990c8bb9a", "message": "unused library", "created_at": "2021-02-10T20:01:29Z", "repo": "DellG5SE-Fan-Linux", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "42b7436ced2f8c2588b5bffcf3dbd19d4fba2ee5", "message": "formatting", "created_at": "2021-02-10T19:50:43Z", "repo": "DellG5SE-Fan-Linux", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "513f4f3d7ae2b64b9a6b34cd2c32b0fe47ac6553", "message": "formatting", "created_at": "2021-02-10T19:46:26Z", "repo": "DellG5SE-Fan-Linux", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fc09967f9e1de279aec7709c338a54bcbfdbb2c2", "message": "Fan profiles", "created_at": "2021-02-10T19:45:24Z", "repo": "DellG5SE-Fan-Linux", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": nul